                                            "clipping"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ab20f1f-8029-4ae4-88c5-17ef03e78e5d",
                                                "sense_id": "f01377ce-34aa-3a43-9f60-6240489bd971",
                                                "text": "It was nearly eleven o'clock now, and he strolled out again. In the little fair created by the costers' barrows the evening only seemed beginning; and the naphtha flares made one's eyes ache, the men's voices grated harshly, and the girls' faces saddened one."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
